# The move/stop diagnostic's figures, per-iteration data and hash manifest are
# EVIDENCE the report cites, not scratch output.  The repository-wide ignores
# for *.png, *.csv and *.txt are right for generated plots and scratch data
# elsewhere; inside this tree those files are the record, so they are
# re-included here and nowhere else.
!*.png
!*.csv
!*.txt

# Raw solver state stays ignored: 37 MB of per-iteration density history that is
# fully reproducible from code/ and already summarised in the committed CSVs and
# METRICS.json.
*.mat
